{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2023-01-24 07:15:00', 'title': 'HENRY SCHEIN TO HOST 2023 INVESTOR MEETING', 'text': "MELVILLE, N.Y.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--HENRY SCHEIN, INC. (NASDAQ: HSIC), THE WORLD'S LARGEST PROVIDER OF HEALTH CARE SOLUTIONS TO OFFICE-BASED DENTAL AND MEDICAL PRACTITIONERS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL HOLD AN INVESTOR MEETING ON FEBRUARY 27, 2023, AT 9:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME. THE MEETING WILL PROVIDE AN OPPORTUNITY FOR INVESTORS AND ANALYSTS TO HEAR FROM MEMBERS OF HENRY SCHEIN'S EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM ABOUT THE COMPANY'S BOLD +1 STRATEGIC PLAN FOR SUSTAINABLE GROWTH AND VALUE CREATION. THE PRESENTATION WILL INCLUDE DETAILS ABOUT HENRY SCHEIN'S 2023 FINANCIAL GUIDANCE AND LONG-TERM FINANCIAL OUTLOOK."}